{"video":"xq27j9NyOgE","lines":[{"t":[0,1.1],"en":"What is your situation?"},{"t":[2,3.5],"en":"Oh, well, it's complicated."},{"t":[3.7,5.7],"en":"I don't actually have a boyfriend, but, uh..."},{"t":[5.7,6.7],"en":"Then can I have your number?"},{"t":[8.9,10.1],"en":"I'm sorry, no."},{"t":[11,11.5],"en":"Okay."},{"t":[12.5,13.2],"en":"No, sure."},{"t":[16.3,18.1],"en":"Oh, my God, you're giving your real number."},{"t":[21.2,22.3],"en":"Okay, thanks."},{"t":[22.5,23.6],"en":"I'll give you a call later tonight."},{"t":[25.2,25.7],"en":"Bye."},{"t":[26.1,26.5],"en":"Bye."},{"t":[28.1,28.5],"en":"Wow."},{"t":[29,30.4],"en":"So that's great."},{"t":[31.1,32.7],"en":"You, Bill, Ross, and Emma"},{"t":[32.7,34],"en":"are gonna be so happy together."},{"t":[35,36],"en":"What were you thinking?"},{"t":[36.5,37.3],"en":"I don't know."},{"t":[37.5,39.2],"en":"He was cute and he liked me."},{"t":[39.3,40],"en":"It was an impulse."},{"t":[40.5,41.6],"en":"But what about Ross?"},{"t":[41.6,42.4],"en":"What about your moment?"},{"t":[42.6,44.3],"en":"Don't you want to talk to Ross about it?"},{"t":[44.4,46.1],"en":"No, no, because I know exactly"},{"t":[46.1,47.5],"en":"how the conversation's gonna go."},{"t":[48.2,48.8],"en":"Hey, Ross."},{"t":[49.3,50.9],"en":"You know, I think we had a moment before."},{"t":[51.5,53.5],"en":"Yeah, me too."},{"t":[54.8,56.4],"en":"Well, but I'm not sure"},{"t":[56.4,58],"en":"I really want to do anything about it."},{"t":[58.1,60.3],"en":"Yeah, me neither."},{"t":[61.7,62.8],"en":"Well, should we just continue"},{"t":[62.8,63.5],"en":"to live together"},{"t":[63.5,64.4],"en":"and not really tell each other"},{"t":[64.4,65.2],"en":"how we're really feeling?"},{"t":[65.9,67.2],"en":"Yeah, that works for me."}]}
